Description: This package contains functions for generating pseudorandom
    numbers from the Curve probability distribution. It includes functions
    to calculate the probability density function, cumulative distribution
    function, quantiles and random samples. It also provides a Chi-square
    goodness-of-fit test to determine whether a sample follows the
    theoretical Curve distribution.
